  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Header.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"645\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">透過 <strong>Unlocked Typing</strong>，您可以在通常會封鎖的輸入框中自由使用 &sect; 顏色與格式代碼，包括：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🪧 <strong>告示牌</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">📘 <strong>書與羽毛筆</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">⚒ <strong>鐵砧</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🌍 <strong>世界名稱</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">💬 <strong>聊天視窗</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">支援的顏色與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fFormatting_codes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>格式代碼</strong></span></a> 包含：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&sect;0-&sect;f 用於顏色，&sect;l、&sect;o、&sect;n、&sect;m、&sect;k、&sect;r 用於格式設定。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器才能和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Promo.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"253\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或整合包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是您的最佳選擇！他們提供性價比最高的 Minecraft 伺服器，若點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用折扣碼「Lupin」，即可享有 25% 的優惠。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Description.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">Unlocked Typing 讓您可以自由在通常會封鎖的輸入框中使用顏色與格式代碼（&sect;），適用於告示牌、書與羽毛筆、鐵砧、世界名稱及聊天視窗。它支援顏色代碼 &sect;0&ndash;&sect;f 以及格式代碼 &sect;l、&sect;o、&sect;n、&sect;m、&sect;k 和 &sect;r，讓您能完全自由地以獨特色彩與樣式自訂文字。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它在伺服器上能運作嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全沒問題！記得搭配模組與朋友同樂的最佳方式就是使用 BisectHosting，透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結即可享有 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個模組能用於整合包嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！只要僅限於在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上發布即可。上傳至任何其他平台都將侵犯我們的權益，且絕對不被允許。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，若您考慮將其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我們將深感感謝。如需進行任何調整或有疑問，歡迎隨時聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製關於此模組的影片並發布在我的頻道嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！您完全可以自由在您的頻道遊玩此模組或我們的任何整合包，並製作相關影片。事實上，我們將非常感激您的支持！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"168\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/460/unlocked-typing-1.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/462/unlocked-typing-3.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/466/unlocked-typing-6.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/A4L1r9kw9Xc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
